### ==========================================
### DASHBOARD: USER ACTIONS (JOINING & LEAVING)
### ==========================================

### 1. Send Join Request
POST http://localhost:5001/dashboard/user-teams/create-request HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "teamId": "6a36bccf19441519d1831206", 
    "message": "I have experience with the MERN stack and would love to contribute to this project!"
}

### 2. Get All My Sent Requests
GET http://localhost:5001/dashboard/user-teams/all-requests HTTP/1.1

### 3. Get Teams I have Joined
GET http://localhost:5001/dashboard/user-teams/joined-teams HTTP/1.1

### 4. Leave a Team
DELETE http://localhost:5001/dashboard/user-teams/6a36bb1419441519d1831205/leave HTTP/1.1


### ==========================================
### DASHBOARD: LEADER ACTIONS (MANAGING TEAMS)
### ==========================================

### 5. Get All Teams I Manage
GET http://localhost:5001/dashboard/manageMyTeams HTTP/1.1

### 6. Get Specific Team Details for Editing
GET http://localhost:5001/dashboard/manageMyTeams/team/6a36bb1419441519d1831205 HTTP/1.1

### 7. Update Team Details
PUT http://localhost:5001/dashboard/manageMyTeams/updateTeam/6a36bb1419441519d1831205 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "teamName": "Updated Team Name",
    "description": "Updated description for the project.",
    "category": "AI/ML",
    "mode": "Hybrid",
    "maxMembers": 6,
    "status": "Recruiting"
}

### 8. Remove a Member from the Team
# Replace teamId and memberId with actual ObjectIds
DELETE http://localhost:5001/dashboard/manageMyTeams/6a36bb1419441519d1831205/member/6a2962739ac53ce9d6504062 HTTP/1.1


### ==========================================
### DASHBOARD: NOTIFICATIONS (ACCEPT/REJECT)
### ==========================================

### 9. Get Pending Join Requests (Action Center)
GET http://localhost:5001/dashboard/manageNotifications HTTP/1.1

### 10. Handle Join Request (Accept)
# Replace {requestId} with the actual JoinRequest _id from the fetch above
PUT http://localhost:5001/dashboard/manageNotifications/6a36cc2519441519d1831209 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "action": "accept" 
}

### 11. Handle Join Request (Reject)
PUT http://localhost:5001/dashboard/manageNotifications/6a36cc2519441519d1831209 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "action": "reject" 
}
